IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
    PROGRAM-ID. Viosnuningur.

DATA DIVISION.
    WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 WS-IDX PIC 9(3).
        01 WS-IP1 PIC X(1000).
        01 WS-ANSWER PIC X(1000) VALUE SPACES.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-IP1.
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-IP1 TRAILING)) TO WS-IDX.
    MOVE FUNCTION REVERSE(WS-IP1(1:WS-IDX)) TO WS-ANSWER.
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ANSWER TRAILING).

STOP RUN.
